WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.759
"Match complete": the winner, the results of each set and the sanctions.

2
00:00:02.809 --> 00:00:09.809
Both captains sign: "Tap to sign".

3
00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:16.593
Remarks, if any: "Edit remarks".

4
00:00:16.643 --> 00:00:23.643
"Confirm and approve" locks the result and makes the scoresheet PDF.

5
00:00:27.574 --> 00:00:34.574
"Scoresheet" → "Preview" shows the scoresheet.

6
00:00:36.874 --> 00:00:40.148
"Save PDF" saves it as a file.

7
00:00:40.198 --> 00:00:44.005
"Close match" finishes the match on this device.
